OL,3,A'It smells like charred earth': BBC at
OL,4,AIndonesia fire epicentre causing
OL,5,ASingapore and Malaysia haze crisis
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe BBC is on the ground in Indonesia's
OL,8,FCentral Kalimantan where burning
OL,9,Fpeatlands continue to blanket large
OL,10,Fparts of South East Asia in toxic smog
OL,12,FA pungent charred earth smell wafts
OL,13,Fthrough the air and smoke billows from
OL,14,Fthe ground, as peatlands continue to
OL,15,Fburn underground, our Indonesia
OL,16,Fcorrespondent Liza Tambunan reports
OL,18,FThe haze has brought toxic air to
OL,19,FIndonesia, Malaysia, Singapore and
OL,20,Fparts of the Philippines for weeks now.
OL,21,FIn Indonesia alone, tens of thousands
OL,22,Fhave fallen ill
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,0,100
