OL,3,A'It smells like charred earth': BBC at
OL,4,AIndonesia fire epicentre causing
OL,5,ASingapore and Malaysia haze crisis
OL,6,
OL,7,FPressure is mounting on Indonesia to
OL,8,Fstop the fires that are causing the
OL,9,Fhaze, which have been made worse by an
OL,10,Funusually strong El Nino
OL,12,FSingapore has warned companies blamed
OL,13,Ffor the haze, saying its "determination
OL,14,Fto act" should not be underestimated
